        "b": 461.0039489281769
      },
      "content": "Handle the used level enable to maintain the same level in the same direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0392",
      "reading_order": 511,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.38,
        "t": 378.91466,
        "r": 523.4815379999995,
        "b": 353.0630489281768
      },
      "content": "Keep the contact face of level clean to prevent dust, etc. from penetrating the level in measuring."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0393",
      "reading_order": 512,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.378998,
        "t": 344.89475600000003,
        "r": 523.496568,
        "b": 319.04314492817684
      },
      "content": "Uncontrolled level of the machine may result in malfunction due to declination or worn at the wet moving part of bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0394",
      "reading_order": 513,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37899799999997,
        "t": 308.5351820000001,
        "r": 473.41861199999954,
        "b": 299.66346292817684
      },
      "content": "When move the level, be careful not to be interfered with chuck and tail stock."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0395",
      "reading_order": 514,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37986799999999,
        "t": 261.974648,
        "r": 515.0315399999998,
        "b": 253.10292892817677
      },
      "content": "In the last horizontal levelling, do a job with the foundation bolt and nut tightened firmly."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0396",
      "reading_order": 515,
      "section": "5. Adjustment of Level",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37986799999996,
        "t": 244.99475599999994,
        "r": 395.45486399999913,
        "b": 236.12303692817682
      },
      "content": "After installing the machine, perform the levelling as follows."
